        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> to <span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span></p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The troop lashes out at any enemies in their squares or within @Template[type:emanation|distance:5]{5 feet} (@Check[type:reflex|dc:22|basic:true] save). The effect depends on the number of actions.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> @Damage[(3d6+3)[bludgeoning]] damage</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> @Damage[(4d6+4)[bludgeoning]] damage, creatures that fail their save are forcibly moved 5 ft towards the center of the horde.</p>\n<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">3</span> @Damage[(4d6+4)[bludgeoning]] damage, creatures that fail their save are forcibly moved 10 ft towards the center of the horde.</p>"
        },
