        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The undead horde is so vast and numerous that it seemingly has no end. This effectively makes it immune to all damage. If the undead horde is targeted with a Strike from a hacked Unshaper, the Strike automatically succeeds, the horde loses its immunity to damage from this ability (as its members are culled in uncountable numbers), and then the hacked Unshaper is destroyed after the Strike is resolved.</p>"
